{"applicability_conditions":"用于表征代表性体积元（RVE）中呈现混合晶粒状态的晶粒尺寸分布，2D用面积加权、3D用体积加权计算平均晶粒尺寸。","identity":{"block_id":"b0095","equation_id":"equation_023","equation_number":"23","is_image":false,"latex_hint":"$$\n\\left\\{ \\begin{array}{l} \\boldsymbol {d} _ {2 D} = \\frac {\\sum \\boldsymbol {A} _ {r} \\boldsymbol {d} _ {r}}{\\sum \\boldsymbol {A} _ {r}} \\\\ \\boldsymbol {d} _ {3 D} = \\frac {\\sum \\boldsymbol {V} _ {r} \\boldsymbol {d} _ {r}}{\\sum \\boldsymbol {V} _ {r}} \\end{array} \\right.\\tag{23}\n$$","paper_id":"10.1016_j.ijplas.2025.104353"},"latex":"\\left\\{ \\begin{array}{l} \\boldsymbol {d} _ {2 D} = \\frac {\\sum \\boldsymbol {A} _ {r} \\boldsymbol {d} _ {r}}{\\sum \\boldsymbol {A} _ {r}} \\\\ \\boldsymbol {d} _ {3 D} = \\frac {\\sum \\boldsymbol {V} _ {r} \\boldsymbol {d} _ {r}}{\\sum \\boldsymbol {V} _ {r}} \\end{array} \\right.\\tag{23}","purpose":"计算2D和3D下的平均晶粒尺寸（AGS），分别以晶粒面积和晶粒体积为权重对晶粒直径进行加权平均。","symbols":[{"is_constant":false,"meaning":"2D平均晶粒尺寸（AGS in 2D）","symbol":"d_{2D}","unit":null,"value":null},{"is_constant":false,"meaning":"3D平均晶粒尺寸（AGS in 3D）","symbol":"d_{3D}","unit":null,"value":null},{"is_constant":false,"meaning":"RVE中第r个晶粒的直径","symbol":"d_r","unit":null,"value":null},{"is_constant":false,"meaning":"第r个晶粒的面积","symbol":"A_r","unit":null,"value":null},{"is_constant":false,"meaning":"第r个晶粒的体积","symbol":"V_r","unit":null,"value":null}],"unmapped":["RVE 表示代表性体积元（representative volume element）","AGS 表示平均晶粒尺寸（average grain size）","SD 表示标准差（standard deviation）"]}